@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core

### Grup 9: Flow Types — Core (C) and SubProcess (P)

### ===== CORE FLOW TYPE TEST =====

### Adim 1: Core Flow Baslat
# @name startCore
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/core-flow-test/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "core-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["test", "core-flow"],
  "attributes": {}
}

### Core Instance ID yakala
@coreInstanceId = {{startCore.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 2: Core State Kontrol (auto transition ile core-completed'a gecmis olmali)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/core-flow-test/instances/{{coreInstanceId}}/functions/state

### ===== SUBPROCESS FLOW TYPE TEST =====

### Adim 3: SubProcess Flow Baslat
# @name startSubProcess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/subprocess-flow-test/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "subprocess-test-{{$timestamp}}",
  "tags": ["test", "subprocess-flow"],
  "attributes": {}
}

### SubProcess Instance ID yakala
@subProcessInstanceId = {{startSubProcess.response.body.$.id}}

### Adim 4: SubProcess State Kontrol
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/subprocess-flow-test/instances/{{subProcessInstanceId}}/functions/state

### ===== FLOW TYPE (F) TEST =====

### Adim 5: Flow (F) Baslat
