### Adim 6: Flow State Kontrol (auto transition ile flow-completed'a gecmis olmali)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/flow-flow-test/instances/{{flowInstanceId}}/functions/state

### ===== SUBFLOW TYPE (S) TEST =====

### Adim 7: SubFlow (S) Baslat
